After a prior cleanup removed the success SnackBar from `_saveToFile`, an empty `if (mounted) {}` guard was left behind as dead code.

## Changes
- **`lib/screens/settings/socket_log_screen.dart`**: Delete the no-op `if (mounted) {}` block following `file.writeAsString(logText)` in `_saveToFile`

```dart
// Before
await file.writeAsString(logText);

if (mounted) {}  // ← dead code, removed
} catch (e) { ... }

// After
await file.writeAsString(logText);
} catch (e) { ... }
```

